OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 10 APR
OL,4,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,5,     GJerome Kuhn conducts the BBC
OL,6,     GConcert Orchestra in music which
OL,7,     Gfeatures American songs from
OL,8,     Gsoprano Alison Scherzer. Recorded
OL,9,     Gat Chichester Festival Theatre in
OL,10,     GJanuary.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Healing Musicians
OL,12,     GKate Kennedy hears from young
OL,13,     Gmusicians Rebecca Toal and Hattie
OL,14,     GButterworth how mental health
OL,15,     Gissues forced them to rethink
OL,16,     Gtheir relationship with their
OL,17,     Ginstruments.
